    "created_at": "2023-10-10T03:12:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-10T03:12:49Z",
    "body": "The HTML Standard does not generally specify the UI details of controls, as that is up to a user agent. For example, the fact that some user agents use spinner buttons is entirely their choice; you could also have a variety of other interfaces. (And, on different devices, you often do see other interfaces.)\r\n\r\nSo, I don't think this is really within the scope of the HTML Standard.",
