    "created_at": "2023-10-11T09:32:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-11T09:32:31Z",
    "body": "> Agreed, though I can't find anything in the specification with respect to vertical rendering. How did that end up being part of Interop 2023 to begin with? @zcorpan do you know?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure. It wasn't part of @josepharhar [original test list](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/11#issuecomment-976047408) AFAICT, and per @foolip in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/119#issuecomment-1413990915 only Grid and Flexbox increased the scope from 2022 to 2023, yet the `.optional` tests were added in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt-metadata/commit/bc63a7b65a0b1cf087f63d9616f18819b0d295cf",
